WEBVTT

00:12:57.231 --> 00:13:00.442
So I think it’s an amazing
time to be alive,

00:13:00.442 --> 00:13:05.030
because what we do next will forever
change the course of human history.

00:13:06.031 --> 00:13:09.535
So now is the time to seize
the opportunity

00:13:09.535 --> 00:13:11.870
and expand humanity
throughout the cosmos.

00:13:12.371 --> 00:13:13.372
Thank you.

00:13:13.497 --> 00:13:18.836
(Applause)